    "tailoredResume": "**### text**# Alex Demo\nalex@example.com · (555) 010-2020 · Austin, TX · [github.com/alexdemo](https://github.com/alexdemo)\n\n## Summary\nFrontend-focused engineer who ships **accessible, fast React UIs** and enjoys turning messy requirements into clean interfaces.\n\n## Skills\n- TypeScript, React, Next.js, CSS\n- Node.js, Playwright, Vite\n\n## Experience\n### Frontend Engineer Intern — Brightloop (May 2024 – Aug 2024)\n- Rebuilt the onboarding flow in React, lifting activation by 18%\n- Cut bundle size 32% by code-splitting and trimming dependencies\n\n### Teaching Assistant — UT Austin (2023 – 2024)\n- Led weekly labs on data structures for 40+ students\n\n## Projects\n### Resume Studio\n- A visual Markdown resume editor with live PDF export\n\n## Education\n**University of Texas at Austin** — BS Computer Science, 2025"
